[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3775397516","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115190#issuecomment-3775397516","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115190","id":3775397516,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7hB_6M","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-20T23:17:46Z","updated_at":"2026-01-20T23:17:46Z","body":"Thanks!\r\n\r\nDo we really want to expose this through a singleton? That's certainly the pattern we'd use in godot_openxr_vendors, but since this is in Godot and it's an EXT, we could add the methods and signal on `OpenXRInterface` and keep the singleton unexposed?\r\n\r\nI think we should discuss this, because I feel like the latter fits in more with what we've done in Godot historically. We could start switching to more of the \"exposed singleton\" model, but if we do, it should be a deliberate choice","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3775397516/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3775538007","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115190#issuecomment-3775538007","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115190","id":3775538007,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7hCiNX","user":{"login":"m4gr3d","id":914968,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxNDk2OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/914968?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d","html_url":"https://github.com/m4gr3d","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-21T00:14:21Z","updated_at":"2026-01-21T00:14:39Z","body":"> Thanks!\r\n> \r\n> Do we really want to expose this through a singleton? That's certainly the pattern we'd use in godot_openxr_vendors, but since this is in Godot and it's an EXT, we could add the methods and signal on `OpenXRInterface` and keep the singleton unexposed?\r\n> \r\n> I think we should discuss this, because I feel like the latter fits in more with what we've done in Godot historically. We could start switching to more of the \"exposed singleton\" model, but if we do, it should be a deliberate choice\r\n\r\nLet's discuss during the XR meeting on Thursday. I'm not opposed to this approach as I think shoving everything into `OpenXRInterface` won't scale as the number of EXT / KHR extensions keep growing. But there's an argument to be made about hiding OpenXR specific references from the end users, and allowing for cross XR api abstractions via the use of `XRInterface`.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3775538007/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3781519523","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115190#issuecomment-3781519523","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115190","id":3781519523,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7hZWij","user":{"login":"BastiaanOlij","id":1945449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDU0NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1945449?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij","html_url":"https://github.com/BastiaanOlij","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-21T22:57:42Z","updated_at":"2026-01-21T22:57:42Z","body":"When we originally discussed support for this extension the idea was to add signals to `OpenXRInterface` along side our existing session state changes. That said, seeing we're already exposing more singletons like we do with spatial entities and many of the vendor extensions, I'm not against that approach at all.\r\n\r\nIndeed, let's discuss tomorrow in a wider group during the meeting.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3781519523/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3787577876","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115190#issuecomment-3787577876","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115190","id":3787577876,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7hwdoU","user":{"login":"BastiaanOlij","id":1945449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDU0NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1945449?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij","html_url":"https://github.com/BastiaanOlij","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-23T00:38:11Z","updated_at":"2026-01-23T00:38:11Z","body":"During XR Meeting: Prefer for something this small to go through OpenXRInterface. For Vendor extensions it makes sense that we do everything through singletons but here it just adds too many.\r\n\r\nWe should have our extension wrapper class call into OpenXRInterface, and have OpenXRInterface emit the signal\r\nFor properties, expose property on OpenXRInterface and call into the extension wrapper. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3787577876/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3812132264","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115190#issuecomment-3812132264","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115190","id":3812132264,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7jOIWo","user":{"login":"ashwinvbs","id":8419527,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0MTk1Mjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8419527?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashwinvbs","html_url":"https://github.com/ashwinvbs","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashwinvbs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashwinvbs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashwinvbs/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashwinvbs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashwinvbs/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashwinvbs/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashwinvbs/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashwinvbs/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashwinvbs/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-28T15:55:45Z","updated_at":"2026-01-28T15:55:45Z","body":"@dsnopek @BastiaanOlij I have modifi